      ],
      "content": "TL 10 NW                    ST MICHAEL           BEECHTREE LANE                                                  (west side) 9/253                                            Westwick Hall GV                                               II Farmhouse.  Mid-late C17 timber frame, recased in red brick 1794 (dated brick);  extended at rear 1814 (dated brick).  1930s plain tile hipped roof.   2 storeys over cellar.   5 C20 glazing bar casements.   Front elevation has a central projection with broad ground floor window in relieving arch.  Added porch on right with early C19 door:   4 panels,  shaped brackets.   Interior of projection has ovolo-moulded beams.  Main range is 5 bays of one build with chamfer-stopped beams.  On rear ground floor is a C17 3-light mullioned casement with original square leading and spring catch. Listing NGR: TL1041106805"
    }
